WEBVTT

NOTE
The tour has music and sound effects but no speech. Everything it says is
on screen, and the homepage lists it as text under the video.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
[Upbeat electronic music]

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.000
[The beat kicks in]

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.500
[A chime: the answer is correct]

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.000
[The music changes to a new melody]

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:53.000
[The music turns soft and airy]

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.500
[The music swells for the finale]

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.000
[The music fades out]
